          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "accoster is built on coste, the old form of côte 'side, coast', which is inherited from Latin costa 'rib, side' (Lewis & Short): to bring the ship's side to the shore."
            }
          ]
        },
