              "text": "tanguer — \"to pitch (of a boat); to sway\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Avec le vent, le bateau tangue beaucoup. In the wind the boat pitches a lot."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Tanguer is front to back; rouler is side to side."
            }
          ]
